{c: Verse 1}
[A#],        Jahaan woh jaayegi,
[A#],        Wahin hum jaayenge
[A#],        Jahaan woh jaayegi,
[A#],        Wahin hum jaayenge
[A#] [Gm],        Khud ko kya samajhati hain
[D#] [F],        Kitanaa akadati hain
[A#] [Gm],        Kaulej mein nayi nayi
[D#] [F],        Aayi ek ladaki hain
[D#] [A#],        Ho yaaron yeh Humen
[D#] [A#],        lagati hain sirafiri
[A#] [F],        Aao chakhaa den mazaa
[A#] [G#],        Taubaa taubaa ye ada
[A#] [G#],        Deewani hain kya pataa
[F#],        Puuchho ye kis baat pe
[G#] [A#],        Itanaa itaraati hain
[A#] [G#],        Jaane kis ki bhuul hain
[A#] [G#],        Ye gobhi ka phool hain
[F#],        Billi jaise lagati hain
[G#] [A#],        Mekap jab karati hain
[Gm] [F],        Gaalon pe jo laali hain
[A#] [F],        Hothon pe gaali hain
[Gm] [F],        Ye jo nakhare vaali hain
[A#] [F],        Ladaki hai ya hai bala
[A#] [Gm],        Khud ko kya samajhataa hain
[D#] [F],        Kitanaa akadataa hain
[A#] [Gm],        Kaulej ka nayaa nayaa
[D#] [F],        Majanuu yeh lagataa hain
[D#] [A#],        Humase ho gayaa
[D#] [A#],        Ab isakaa saamanaa
[A#] [F],        Aao chakhaa den mazaa
[A#] [G#],        Humako detaa hai gulaab
[A#] [G#],        Niyat isaki hai kharaab
[F#],        Saavan ke andhe ko to
[G#] [A#],        Hariyaali dikhati hain
[A#] [G#],        Kya isako ye hosh hain
[A#] [G#],        Ye dharati par bojh hain
[F#],        Mard hain yeh sirf naam ka
[G#] [A#],        Aakhir kis kaam ka
[Gm] [F],        Cheharaa ab kyon laal hain
[A#] [F],        Badali kyon chaal hain
[Gm] [F],        Are itana ab kyon behaal hain
[A#] [F],        Hum bhi to dekhen zaraa
Khud ko kya samajhataa hain,        Kitanaa akadataa hain
Kaulej ka nayaa nayaa,        Majanuu yeh lagataa hain
Humase aankhen chaar karo,        Chhodo gussaa pyaar karo
Yaaron ke hum yaar hain,        Ladanaa bekaar hain
Ulajhan mein ye pad gaye,        Shaayad hum se dar gaye
Denge bhar ke pyaar ke,        Dekho ye haar ke
Pyaar ki ye reet hain,        Haar bhi jeet hain
Sabase badh kar preet hain,        Lagajaa gale dilarubaa.
